{"message":"Calculating after-tax share-based compensation as (compensation cost) less (income tax benefit), then percentage change from 2009 to 2010.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"(( (18.1 - 6.3) - (14.6 - 5.2) ) / (14.6 - 5.2)) * 100","variables":{"2010_after_tax":{"value":"18.1 - 6.3","source":"table: share-based compensation cost 18.1 and income tax benefit -6.3"},"2009_after_tax":{"value":"14.6 - 5.2","source":"table: share-based compensation cost 14.6 and income tax benefit -5.2"}},"sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t1c2n0","source:t2c2n0"]}}